   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "Note"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "Testing-only workflow for the sweep harness; hidden from the template browser. Based on dgx-monarch-flux3-klein-edit, with only the changes needed for this test. Two 4:3 references, 1600x1200 then 1024x768, each scaled to about 1 MP and cropped to a 73 by 55 grid. The render has 4015 image rows and a joint stream of 4015 + 8030 + 80 = 12125 rows, so both phases pad at uly2, the shard boundary falls inside the reference rows, and the second reference takes the next reference index. The media widgets name the synthetic files benchmark/sweep/media.py writes into comfy's input folder."
   ],
   "title": "DGX Monarch | FLUX.3 Klein edit with two references"
  },
